cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below, together with the paper it supports."
type: software
title: "Billiards in triangles: code deposit for five papers"
abstract: >-
  Exact-arithmetic code supporting five papers on billiards in triangles: The orphan
  theorem; The necklace of a rational right triangle; No arrivals; Non-perpendicular
  periodic orbits in mirror directions of right triangles; and Singular perpendicular orbits
  and complete periodicity in rational triangles. A small core library (lib/) and one
  directory per paper holding one script per statement; MANIFEST.md maps each script to the
  statement it supports.
authors:
  - family-names: Boorstein
    given-names: Joshua
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-1291-2321"
version: "v1.1"
date-released: "2026-11-09"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/josh-boorstein/billiards"
keywords:
  - billiards
  - right triangles
  - rational triangles
  - translation surfaces
  - periodic orbits
  - exact arithmetic
